        {
          "text": "Lino uwe, O mwana amuntu, mubuzuba obo nzoobanyanzya ciyubilo cabo, lukondo lwabo abulemu bwabo, zintu zibotezya meso aabo, amyoyo yabo nziiyanda, bana babo balombe abasimbi, ",
